  "experiment_note": "v1.5: untested risk-normalized momentum-entry comparison, based on v1.3_fixed_40. Same V4 environment schema and JSON keys. Fixed +40 premium target is disabled; estimated net +1.0R target uses a premium stop distance max(25 points, 6% of entry premium, 1.2 x option ATR when available), plus the existing underlying structural stop. Gaps, slippage and costs can make realized losses exceed -1R. PPO remains entry-only; no learned EXIT, entry/overtrade penalties or reason-specific shaping. Liquidity/delta checks supplement existing moderate reference/momentum/quality gates; hard path-efficiency, ATR-expansion, price-OI, structural-distance and acceleration gates remain off. Entry window 09:35-14:45, 30-minute maximum hold, adaptive cooldown with 5-minute base (R_TARGET uses the base cooldown). PPO rollouts are 2048 steps with 3 seeds; 300000 requested steps round to 294912 total. Validation targets are win rate >=70%, net-point profit factor >=1.5 and average R >=0.10, with at least 100 validation trades. Profit factor 1.5 is not a 1.5R per-trade target. No performance guarantee: no training, backtest or test-set tuning was performed. Load into the legacy minute trainer, start fresh, compare validation results, and reserve test data for final assessment."
